description.narrative:
The goal of the project is to strengthen the resilience of the Rohingya population through community infrastructure development and asset creation. The project will also contribute to the local economy and rehabilitate the environment within and around the camps. The specific objectives of the project are to:
1)	Mitigate disaster risks, and improve accessibility and livelihood through the construction of schemes;
2)	Enhance access to food and non-food items for FDMNs through cash for work activities.
